      "section": "opening",
      "slot": "opening",
      "text": "Aspose.BarCode FOSS for Python generates deterministic, standards-compliant barcodes for linear and 2D symbologies including Code 128, Code 39 (base and Extended), EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, and QR Code. It encodes data through dedicated helper functions or the generic generate entry point, returning a Barcode object that supports to_png and to_svg output methods. Rendering options are configured via RenderOptions and resolved via ResolvedRenderOptions, and rendering is performed by renderers such as SvgRenderer, PngRenderer, and PdfRenderer. The library produces PNG and SVG output with no system-level dependencies beyond Pillow for PNG output."
    },
    {
