        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.upce"
      ],
      "section": "key_capabilities",
      "slot": "capability:1",
      "text": "It generates barcodes using the code128, code39, code39ext, ean13, ean8, upca, upce, qr, and generate functions."
    },
