      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "scope",
      "text": "Aspose.BarCode FOSS for Python generates (encodes) barcodes in PNG and SVG formats for every symbology. PDF rendering is not implemented — Barcode.to_pdf raises NotImplementedError. ECI normalization and validation and GS1 data parsing and validation are not implemented, even though EncodeOptions exposes eci_assignment_number and gs1_enabled fields."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "inherited_unit:052.list",
        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.barcode.to_pdf"
      ],
      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "limitation:1",
      "text": "PDF rendering is not implemented — Barcode.to_pdf raises NotImplementedError."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "inherited_unit:052.list",
        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.encodeoptions"
      ],
      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "limitation:2",
      "text": "ECI normalization and validation and GS1 data parsing and validation are not implemented, even though EncodeOptions exposes eci_assignment_number and gs1_enabled fields."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "inherited_unit:051.heading",
        "inherited_unit:052.list",
