        "public_symbol:aspose_barcode_foss.encodeoptions"
      ],
      "section": "scope_limitations",
      "slot": "limitation:3",
      "text": "The library only generates (encodes) barcodes — it does not read or decode existing barcode images for any symbology. PDF rendering is not implemented — Barcode.to_pdf raises NotImplementedError. ECI normalization and validation and GS1 data parsing and validation are not implemented, even though EncodeOptions exposes eci_assignment_number and gs1_enabled fields."
    },
